    {
      "id": "L422-S01",
      "text": "我們班的教室在辦公室前面。",
      "spokenText": "我們班的教室在辦公室前面",
      "displayLines": [
        "我們班的教室",
        "在辦公室",
        "前面。"
      ],
      "focusChar": "班",
      "imageNotes": "學校走廊，主角小女孩向主角爸爸介紹自己班的教室。使用能清楚看出前後位置的斜側視角：教室位於較前方，辦公室在其後方，女孩指向前方教室。教室內可見成排學生桌椅、書包與黑板；辦公室內可見成人辦公桌、文件與工作中的老師。兩處入口與用途都要可辨識，不只畫單一房門。不要畫成左右相鄰卻看不出前後，也不要依靠可讀門牌或班級數字說明位置。",
      "imagePrompt": "Use case: illustration-story. Create one square 1:1 modern children’s picture-book illustration matching the attached approved L058 style anchors: warm natural light, fine pencil-and-watercolor linework, detailed but clean environments, consistent expressive preschool proportions, soft cheeks, gentle expressions, bright warm palette and phone-readable composition with safe margins. L058 is style-only, never copy its people as identities. Match the refined L115/L118/L119/L128 examples and the actual L154/L162/L163 protagonist-family cast. Girl: short dark bob, pink clip, pink cardigan, navy skirt, pink shoes; stable preschool age, not a toddler. Recurring mother, father and older brother must match the family identity references. Teacher and generic classmates must stay distinct. No readable text, letters, numbers, zhuyin, signs, watermarks, logos, UI or speech bubbles anywhere. No anime, 3D, photograph, flat cartoon, generic simple watercolor or oversized round heads. Scene requirements: 學校走廊，主角小女孩向主角爸爸介紹自己班的教室。使用能清楚看出前後位置的斜側視角：教室位於較前方，辦公室在其後方，女孩指向前方教室。教室內可見成排學生桌椅、書包與黑板；辦公室內可見成人辦公桌、文件與工作中的老師。兩處入口與用途都要可辨識，不只畫單一房門。不要畫成左右相鄰卻看不出前後，也不要依靠可讀門牌或班級數字說明位置。",
